⚠️ Disclaimer: I prefer to work from home 🏠 if I join any company. I do not like working closely with others 👥 because of my past experiences 💔. Many girls 👩, boys 👦, men 👨, women 👩, seniors 🎓, and junior colleagues 🤝 have cheated me 😞 for their own needs 💰, power 👑, status 🏆, or personal benefits 📈. In the name of love ❤️ and marriage 💍, such betrayals can happen because of money 💸, power ⚡, and competition 🥊. This problem can happen to good boys 👦, men 👨, girls 👧, and women 👩 as well. So, I need to protect my safety 🛡️, peace ☮️, and personal boundaries 🚧.  | 🌍 **Throughout my life**, I have faced 💰 financial hardship, 🏥 health challenges, 💼 career uncertainty, and 📚 difficulties in education and employment, all of which have shaped how I view society and institutions. 🚶‍♂️ My experiences taught me that 🏫 schools, 🎓 colleges, 🏢 employers, and even 🏛️ governments cannot guarantee a secure 💼 job, 💵 financial stability, or 🌟 a successful life. 🤔 I believe the education system I experienced focused more on 📝 memorization than on 🧠 deep understanding, 💡 critical thinking, 🔍 curiosity, and 📖 lifelong learning. Although 🎓 education and 💼 workplaces can provide 🚪 opportunities, I feel that real success comes from 📚 continuous learning, 📝 documentation, 🔄 regular revision, 🛠️ practical experience, 💪 perseverance, and 🚀 personal effort. I have also encountered situations that made me lose trust in some 👥 individuals and 🏢 organizations, leading me to believe that ⚠️ unethical behavior, 🎭 manipulation, ⭐ favoritism, and the pursuit of 💰 money, 🌟 fame, or 👑 power can exist in some 🏫 schools, 🎓 colleges, and 🏢 workplaces. These experiences have led me to prioritize ❤️ my own life, 🏥 health, 🛡️ safety, 💰 financial stability, and 🚀 future over feelings of 🇮🇳 patriotism or 🤝 loyalty to institutions. At the same time, ⚖️ I recognize that not every 👨‍🏫 teacher, 👩‍🏫 professor, 👨‍💼 manager, 👨‍💻 colleague, 🏢 organization, or 🏛️ institution behaves unethically, and that 🧾 responsibility and ⚖️ accountability should always be judged based on 📄 evidence, ✅ facts, and 👤 individual actions rather than assumptions. 🌱 My goal is to continue 📚 learning, 🧠 understanding, 📝 documenting knowledge, 🛠️ building useful technology, 💼 growing professionally, 🤝 acting ethically, and 🚀 creating a better future through 💡 knowledge, 🔬 continuous improvement, ❤️ integrity, and 🌍 meaningful contributions instead of relying on guarantees from others.
I am a developer focused on learning and building projects in computer graphics, real-time rendering, and modern C++ programming. I am exploring low-level programming concepts, WebAssembly, Emscripten, SDL, and cross-platform development while gaining practical experience through hands-on projects. My work involves understanding rendering pipelines, system-level programming, file handling, and performance-oriented techniques. I enjoy experimenting with new technologies, improving my programming skills, and creating efficient solutions by combining theory with practical implementation. I continuously learn through development, debugging, and analyzing how different tools and frameworks work together to build reliable and interactive applications.